                            <comment id="485606" author="aboyko" created="Wed, 28 Jan 2026 13:31:18 +0000">&lt;p&gt;Probably should be skipped for a single node, since it does not touch client.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;My single node setup fails during mount, &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="preformatted panel" style="border-width: 1px;"&gt;&lt;div class="preformattedContent panelContent"&gt;
&lt;pre&gt;[84775.193119] LDISKFS-fs (dm-2): mounted filesystem with ordered data mode. Quota mode: journalled.
[84775.232392] Lustre: lustre-MDT0000: Imperative Recovery not enabled, recovery window 60-180
[84775.232751] Lustre: Skipped 1 previous similar message
[84775.238271] lt-mount.lustre[226273]: segfault at 0 ip 0000000000000000 sp 00007ffda1ddac28 error 14 in lt-mount.lustre[400000+4000]
[84775.238563] Code: Unable to access opcode bytes at RIP 0xffffffffffffffd6. &lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</comment>
